# Auth0 Tenant Configuration

## Applications
1. Web Application (SPA)
   - Type: Single Page Application
   - Allowed Callback URLs: https://app.company.com/callback
   - Allowed Logout URLs: https://app.company.com
   - Allowed Web Origins: https://app.company.com
   - Token Endpoint Auth Method: None (PKCE)

2. API Service
   - Type: Machine to Machine
   - Identifier: https://api.company.com
   - Signing Algorithm: RS256
   - Token Expiration: 86400 seconds

## Rules (Authentication Pipeline)

### Add User Roles
function addUserRoles(user, context, callback) {
  const namespace = 'https://company.com';
  const roles = user.app_metadata?.roles || [];
  context.idToken[`${namespace}/roles`] = roles;
  context.accessToken[`${namespace}/roles`] = roles;
  callback(null, user, context);
}

### Enforce MFA for Admins
function enforceMFAForAdmins(user, context, callback) {
  const roles = user.app_metadata?.roles || [];
  if (roles.includes('admin') && !context.multifactor) {
    context.multifactor = {
      provider: 'any',
      allowRememberBrowser: false
    };
  }
  callback(null, user, context);
}

## Social Connections
- Google OAuth 2.0
- Microsoft Azure AD
- GitHub

## Database Connection
- Username-Password-Authentication
- Password Policy: Good
- MFA: Optional (SMS, TOTP)
